{"id":300,"flavor":[{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Skitty is known to chase around playfully after its own tail. In the wild, this Pokémon lives in holes in the trees of forests. It is very popular as a pet because of its adorable looks."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Skitty has the habit of becoming fascinated by moving objects and chasing them around. This Pokémon is known to chase after its own tail and become dizzy."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"It shows its cute side by chasing its own tail until it gets dizzy."},{"games":["X","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It can’t stop itself from chasing moving things, and it runs in a circle, chasing its own tail."},{"games":["SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It’s adorable when it chases its own tail. It’s difficult to earn its trust."},{"games":["LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"It is said to be difficult to earn its trust. However, it is extremely popular for its cute looks and behavior."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"A SKITTY’s adorably cute behavior makes it highly popular. In battle, it makes its tail puff out. It threatens foes with a sharp growl."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Cute Charm","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon may infatuate attackers that make direct contact with it."},{"name":"Normalize","hidden":false,"description":"All the Pokémon’s moves become Normal type. The power of those moves is boosted a little."},{"name":"Wonder Skin","hidden":true,"description":"Makes status moves more likely to miss the Pokémon."}],"eggGroups":["Field","Fairy"],"genderRate":6,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"fast","habitat":"forest","color":"Pink","shape":"Quadruped","evolution":{"id":300,"name":"Skitty","condition":null,"children":[{"id":301,"name":"Delcatty","condition":"Use Moon Stone","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Ultra Sun / Ultra Moon","level":[[1,33],[1,39],[1,45],[1,252],[4,193],[7,47],[10,213],[13,574],[16,3],[19,383],[22,185],[25,2